WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.545
The moment you've all been waiting for!

00:00:03.629 --> 00:00:05.214
A female poet...

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:06.715
Emily Dickinson.

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:16.767
A woman should receive an education,
but it should not be the same as a man's.

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.312
Maybe they're scared that
if they teach us how the world works,

00:00:20.395 --> 00:00:22.064
we'll figure out how to take over.

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.733
Morning, ladies.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:28.445
I don't know how the two of you
fit into such a tiny bed.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.078
I have one purpose.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.496
To become a great writer.

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:40.374
And there's nothing you can do to stop me.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.127
-She's so insane.
-Of course she's insane.

00:00:44.211 --> 00:00:45.337
She's Emily Dickinson.

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:47.881
You need to cut out these sort of antics.

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:53.011
I have to do something, Sue.

00:00:53.804 --> 00:00:54.930
Desperate times, girl.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.770
Don't act like you're dead
while you're still alive.

00:01:02.312 --> 00:01:05.399
If you want something,
reach out and grab it!

00:01:06.024 --> 00:01:07.025
Sick.

00:01:10.404 --> 00:01:13.407
You'll be the only Dickinson
they talk about in 200 years.

00:01:16.577 --> 00:01:17.578
I promise you that.

00:01:21.123 --> 00:01:23.250
That was a lovely funeral,
don't you think?

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:24.793
Mine'll be better.

